  "slug": "visual-merchandising-count-sheet-form",
  "title": "Visual Merchandising Count Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "A practical reconciliation count sheet for visual merchandising that connects identity, observations and evidence, decision authority, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original retail-operations reconciliation count sheet for visual merchandising covering display execution and release, evidence references, authorization, escalation, operating limits, disposition, and handoff without copying a third-party form.",
  "use_case": "Use when a visual merchandising lead opens one visual merchandising record to set the count basis, preserve expected and observed values, reconcile variances, authorize a result, and hand off unresolved lines; closure requires a documented outcome, evidence route, responsible owner, and recipient acknowledgment.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
