        {
          "key": "count_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Count and decision boundary",
          "guidance": "Do not claim accessibility, electrical, structural, promotional, or legal compliance from this visual record. Stop and restrict a display when conditions exceed current training or authorization. Avoid identifiable customer images unless genuinely required and approved. Follow applicable merchandising, safety, accessibility, privacy, and promotional policy and route judgment to the authorized reviewer."
        }
